# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Re-include the knowledge document and skills dns-mcp embeds via go:embed
# (docs/agent/embed.go). Without these, the container build fails with
# "pattern llms-full.txt: no matching files found".
!docs/agent/llms-full.txt
!docs/agent/skills/*.md
